# scaleup_single_switch_4_100Gbps.topo
# DIAGNOSTIC: 4-host single-switch scale-up domain at 100 Gbps (80 ps/B, no
# quantisation loss). Used only to test which fabric the INC `coll` serializes on:
# if swapping the intranode topo between this (100) and the 12800 variant changes
# the INC makespan, the collective rides the intranode fabric; if not, it rides
# the scale-out fabric. Not a production topo.
Nodes 4
Tiers 2
Podsize 4

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 4
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
Oversubscribed 4

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 300
